  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/ToroVillamalur1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(20 fotos) La madrugada de este s&aacute;bado a domingo, con la actuaci&oacute;n de la orquesta Modena y la discom&oacute;vil, finalizan las fiestas de Villamalur.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/ToroVillamalur2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El viernes, despu&eacute;s de las lluvias intensas ha venido la calma y se ha podido soltar el toro Charanguito, de la ganader&iacute;a Pascual Alcal&aacute;. A partir de las 23.30 horas de este s&aacute;bado se embolar&aacute; el toro Grapas, del hierro Mur Fortanet, probado esta tarde.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6385.jpg\" alt=\"img_6385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6387.jpg\" alt=\"img_6387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6388.jpg\" alt=\"img_6388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6389.jpg\" alt=\"img_6389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6391.jpg\" alt=\"img_6391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6392.jpg\" alt=\"img_6392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bouvillamalur17dissabte/img_6396.jpg\" alt=\"img_6396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"h